      <h1 class="article-title">Letter to Diognetus</h1>
      <p class="article-dek faith-doc-dek">Unknown Author &middot; c. 2nd–3rd Century</p>
      
      <p class="faith-doc-description">12 chapters of early Christian apology on the distinctiveness of the faith.</p>
